cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FlexiProbes in research, please cite it using this record and give the exact version you ran."
title: flexiprobes
abstract: >-
  A desktop and command-line application for designing 10x Genomics Flex v1 /
  Flex v2 / Visium spatial probes, with homology-mode consensus design,
  exhaustive k-mer off-target screening (with a BLAST fallback), orderable IDT
  oPool / Cell Ranger exports, and HPC export/import for memory-heavy
  whole-transcriptome workflows.
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-30"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/Adrian-I-lab/FlexiProbes"
url: "https://github.com/Adrian-I-lab/FlexiProbes"
keywords:
  - probe design
  - 10x Genomics Flex
  - Visium spatial
  - RNA templated ligation
  - oligonucleotide design
  - bioinformatics
